  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"oCpqx\" id=\"oCpqx\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue21e4103\" id=\"ue21e4103\">T113 (TinaLinux) 开启 PPPoE 拨号完整修复指南</span></h1><h2 data-lake-id=\"IhMMF\" id=\"IhMMF\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u624d6c3a\" id=\"u624d6c3a\">硬件层：解封物理网卡（修改设备树）</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u71b8c227\" id=\"u71b8c227\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u73c8bd00\" id=\"u73c8bd00\">现象：</span></strong><code data-lake-id=\"u0a430eb9\" id=\"u0a430eb9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua0c35074\" id=\"ua0c35074\">ifconfig -a</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u9eb85e57\" id=\"u9eb85e57\"> 找不到 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u79715591\" id=\"u79715591\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud79d069b\" id=\"ud79d069b\">eth0</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3846201a\" id=\"u3846201a\"> 物理网卡。 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0e0fe4f8\" id=\"u0e0fe4f8\">原因：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u58e6bbca\" id=\"u58e6bbca\"> 官方默认的开发板设备树中，有线网卡节点处于禁用状态。 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud5670c10\" id=\"ud5670c10\">修复步骤：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uda9a28e7\" id=\"uda9a28e7\"> 打开设备树文件（例如 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u70be255d\" id=\"u70be255d\"><span data-lake-id=\"uecb3480d\" id=\"uecb3480d\">board.dts</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue27ab0c7\" id=\"ue27ab0c7\">），找到 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ucc896242\" id=\"ucc896242\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud308e5e6\" id=\"ud308e5e6\">gmac0</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u210d3d0c\" id=\"u210d3d0c\"> 节点，将其状态改为 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u034812db\" id=\"u034812db\"><span data-lake-id=\"u36a31f08\" id=\"u36a31f08\">okay</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ude8b8f61\" id=\"ude8b8f61\">：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf98dcf08\" id=\"uf98dcf08\"><span data-lake-id=\"u021d4ff7\" id=\"u021d4ff7\">DTS</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22shell%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%26gmac0%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20...%5Cn%20%20%20%20phy-mode%20%3D%20%5C%22rmii%5C%22%3B%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20status%20%3D%20%5C%22okay%5C%22%3B%20%20%2F*%20%E5%B0%86%20disabled%20%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E4%B8%BA%20okay%20*%2F%5Cn%7D%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Tt4gK%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"SBIOc\" id=\"SBIOc\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua9f8889c\" id=\"ua9f8889c\">软件层：开启 PPPoE 应用组件</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ua5c19f92\" id=\"ua5c19f92\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u88581a62\" id=\"u88581a62\">现象：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u392a19fa\" id=\"u392a19fa\"> 系统提示 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ud62a4224\" id=\"ud62a4224\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6d3fd4a7\" id=\"u6d3fd4a7\">/bin/sh: pppd: not found</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ued434173\" id=\"ued434173\">。 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u270add92\" id=\"u270add92\">原因：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua391a129\" id=\"ua391a129\"> TinaLinux 默认为了精简体积，未编译 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ubc000dcb\" id=\"ubc000dcb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6ee811d7\" id=\"u6ee811d7\">ppp</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u64e95317\" id=\"u64e95317\"> 相关组件。 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud64bfef4\" id=\"ud64bfef4\">修复步骤：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf807cc3e\" id=\"uf807cc3e\"> 在 SDK 根目录执行 </span><code data-lake-id=\"udf25ff30\" id=\"udf25ff30\"><span data-lake-id=\"u21f529e0\" id=\"u21f529e0\">make menuconfig</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc174afd1\" id=\"uc174afd1\">，依次进入 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u092bf642\" id=\"u092bf642\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0f7ab341\" id=\"u0f7ab341\">Network</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u80878cd2\" id=\"u80878cd2\"> -&gt; </span><code data-lake-id=\"u57030541\" id=\"u57030541\"><span data-lake-id=\"u50e8bfa0\" id=\"u50e8bfa0\">ppp</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ubd0d65cd\" id=\"ubd0d65cd\">，选中以下两项（按 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u2293ec81\" id=\"u2293ec81\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue0e7b1bd\" id=\"ue0e7b1bd\">Y</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3a93fc7d\" id=\"u3a93fc7d\"> 设置为 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u57c10d97\" id=\"u57c10d97\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0bdf7cea\" id=\"u0bdf7cea\">[*]</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ufd8afba4\" id=\"ufd8afba4\">）：</span></p><ul list=\"uefc66242\"><li fid=\"u4a0729ff\" data-lake-id=\"ud42d3463\" id=\"ud42d3463\"><code data-lake-id=\"u25deb517\" id=\"u25deb517\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1142455f\" id=\"u1142455f\">ppp</span></code></li><li fid=\"u4a0729ff\" data-lake-id=\"ua9424214\" id=\"ua9424214\"><code data-lake-id=\"u0510897e\" id=\"u0510897e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5afe6f6f\" id=\"u5afe6f6f\">ppp-mod-pppoe</span></code></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"ueca3f341\" id=\"ueca3f341\"><em><span data-lake-id=\"u0c17e22a\" id=\"u0c17e22a\">(注：务必确保不要勾选 </span></em><code data-lake-id=\"ufc52153b\" id=\"ufc52153b\"><em><span data-lake-id=\"u640c465a\" id=\"u640c465a\">ppp-mod-pppoatm</span></em></code><em><span data-lake-id=\"uc791c851\" id=\"uc791c851\">，以免引发后续依赖问题。)</span></em></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"EHC0P\" id=\"EHC0P\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u802fbb1c\" id=\"u802fbb1c\">编译层：修复 OpenWrt 遗留 Bug（核心难点）</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u236fd216\" id=\"u236fd216\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua9ce3afb\" id=\"ua9ce3afb\">在编译 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u2008e70f\" id=\"u2008e70f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u126d1d1a\" id=\"u126d1d1a\">ppp</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u833385d3\" id=\"u833385d3\"> 组件时，会遇到两个经典的交叉编译环境报错：</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"trEVf\" id=\"trEVf\"><span data-lake-id=\"u92049770\" id=\"u92049770\">报错 1：缺少 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ud202cd33\" id=\"ud202cd33\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaca530e4\" id=\"uaca530e4\">atm*.h</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue3a3d97c\" id=\"ue3a3d97c\"> 头文件</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u90b73e93\" id=\"u90b73e93\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3af85b92\" id=\"u3af85b92\">原因：</span></strong><code data-lake-id=\"u6432f127\" id=\"u6432f127\"><span data-lake-id=\"u83c6ea2c\" id=\"u83c6ea2c\">ppp</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua3a4f89a\" id=\"ua3a4f89a\"> 源码 Makefile 中的硬编码逻辑错误，强制去内核拷贝已废弃的 ATM 电话线拨号头文件。 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uaaf5505f\" id=\"uaaf5505f\">修复步骤：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc57307a5\" id=\"uc57307a5\"> 编辑 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ua1f43312\" id=\"ua1f43312\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue61f19be\" id=\"ue61f19be\">openwrt/package/network/services/ppp/Makefile</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u7966e268\" id=\"u7966e268\">，找到拷贝 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u579574da\" id=\"u579574da\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua7cc0e57\" id=\"ua7cc0e57\">atm*.h</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3573b0da\" id=\"u3573b0da\"> 的代码行，直接将其注释掉：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u457c9e56\" id=\"u457c9e56\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3c8fb9de\" id=\"u3c8fb9de\">Makefile</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22shell%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%20%20%20%24(CP)%20%5C%5C%5Cn%23%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%24(LINUX_DIR)%2Finclude%2Flinux%2Fcompiler.h%20%5C%5C%5Cn%23%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%24(LINUX_DIR)%2Finclude%2F%24(LINUX_UAPI_DIR)linux%2Fatm*.h%20%5C%5C%5Cn%23%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%24(PKG_BUILD_DIR)%2Fpppd%2Fplugins%2Fpppoatm%2Flinux%2F%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MqS4w%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"SLYRN\" id=\"SLYRN\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub182b0cd\" id=\"ub182b0cd\">报错 2：未定义的引用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u4bbc51e5\" id=\"u4bbc51e5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u290029c5\" id=\"u290029c5\">setkey</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uef880a56\" id=\"uef880a56\"> 和 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ue8a39444\" id=\"ue8a39444\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4473094f\" id=\"u4473094f\">encrypt</span></code></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u67916424\" id=\"u67916424\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ube32d279\" id=\"ube32d279\">原因：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u11fd410e\" id=\"u11fd410e\"> 新版 glibc 移除了不安全的 DES 加密函数，导致旧版 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u2e52aa7e\" id=\"u2e52aa7e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u87fa3b13\" id=\"u87fa3b13\">pppcrypt.c</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0cc3ce99\" id=\"u0cc3ce99\"> 链接失败。 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8d2734e5\" id=\"u8d2734e5\">修复步骤：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u942b16fc\" id=\"u942b16fc\"> 采用手动分步编译法，向源码注入空函数：</span></p><ol list=\"u81459674\"><li fid=\"u4ad2a6c7\" data-lake-id=\"uf342701e\" id=\"uf342701e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ueb0f540a\" id=\"ueb0f540a\">清理缓存：</span><code data-lake-id=\"ue1e920b6\" id=\"ue1e920b6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u06a16fc7\" id=\"u06a16fc7\">make package/network/services/ppp/clean</span></code></li><li fid=\"u4ad2a6c7\" data-lake-id=\"ue8e04463\" id=\"ue8e04463\"><span data-lake-id=\"u81e140e2\" id=\"u81e140e2\">仅解压源码：</span><code data-lake-id=\"ud797a4a5\" id=\"ud797a4a5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4cad76da\" id=\"u4cad76da\">make package/network/services/ppp/prepare</span></code></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u1b0fb947\" id=\"u1b0fb947\"><span data-lake-id=\"u50158ff8\" id=\"u50158ff8\">注入空函数（在终端执行）：</span></p><ol list=\"u81459674\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u4ad2a6c7\" data-lake-id=\"uf4ca1b9e\" id=\"uf4ca1b9e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u00e64fe4\" id=\"u00e64fe4\">Bash</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22cat%20%3C%3C%20'EOF'%20%3E%3E%20%2Froot%2FT113-Tina5.0-V1.2%2Fout%2Ft113%2Fevb1_auto%2Fopenwrt%2Fbuild_dir%2Ftarget%2Flinux-t113-evb1_auto%2Fppp-default%2Fppp-2.4.8.git-2020-10-03%2Fpppd%2Fpppcrypt.c%5Cn%5Cn%2F*%20Dummy%20functions%20to%20bypass%20missing%20glibc%20DES%20encryption%20*%2F%5Cnvoid%20setkey(const%20char%20*key)%20%7B%7D%5Cnvoid%20encrypt(char%20*block%2C%20int%20edflag)%20%7B%7D%5CnEOF%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tw6QC%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ol list=\"u81459674\" start=\"4\"><li fid=\"u4ad2a6c7\" data-lake-id=\"u5df33083\" id=\"u5df33083\"><span data-lake-id=\"u39f1d248\" id=\"u39f1d248\">单独编译模块：</span><code data-lake-id=\"uea9b8418\" id=\"uea9b8418\"><span data-lake-id=\"u99ec0b9f\" id=\"u99ec0b9f\">make package/network/services/ppp/compile</span></code></li></ol><h2 data-lake-id=\"QEiaM\" id=\"QEiaM\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4a93ca6e\" id=\"u4a93ca6e\">内核层：开启底层 PPP 驱动</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ucb1a8774\" id=\"ucb1a8774\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"udd60bccc\" id=\"udd60bccc\">现象：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8b948535\" id=\"u8b948535\"> 拨号日志报错 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u9676e837\" id=\"u9676e837\"><span data-lake-id=\"u80630639\" id=\"u80630639\">Please load the ppp_generic kernel module</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2bfad6a0\" id=\"u2bfad6a0\"> 且缺少 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u4d823acd\" id=\"u4d823acd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u237e9dbd\" id=\"u237e9dbd\">/dev/ppp</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2aaa1e8a\" id=\"u2aaa1e8a\">。 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6e6658f7\" id=\"u6e6658f7\">原因：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7b2076ee\" id=\"u7b2076ee\"> Linux 内核未开启 PPP 基础网络协议驱动。 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u77d0f68f\" id=\"u77d0f68f\">修复步骤：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubbff63b6\" id=\"ubbff63b6\"> 在 SDK 根目录执行 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u84aae43a\" id=\"u84aae43a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub1151085\" id=\"ub1151085\">make kernel_menuconfig</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ufd5bf34f\" id=\"ufd5bf34f\">，进入 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u153f8f78\" id=\"u153f8f78\"><span data-lake-id=\"u96e17ef9\" id=\"u96e17ef9\">Device Drivers</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc622bdea\" id=\"uc622bdea\"> -&gt; </span><code data-lake-id=\"u56b97485\" id=\"u56b97485\"><span data-lake-id=\"u58e20901\" id=\"u58e20901\">Network device support</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u34c5bcb5\" id=\"u34c5bcb5\">，勾选以下项为 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u7ed351c7\" id=\"u7ed351c7\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue8b8c542\" id=\"ue8b8c542\">&lt;*&gt;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uda0c21c3\" id=\"uda0c21c3\">（静态编译进内核）：</span></p><ul list=\"u515882e7\"><li fid=\"ue11fb314\" data-lake-id=\"u384e4e22\" id=\"u384e4e22\"><code data-lake-id=\"ubb73a00f\" id=\"ubb73a00f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9cfbbd84\" id=\"u9cfbbd84\">&lt;*&gt;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf51316c1\" id=\"uf51316c1\"> PPP (point-to-point protocol) support</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u515882e7\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ue11fb314\" data-lake-id=\"u279469e1\" id=\"u279469e1\"><code data-lake-id=\"uf10c2098\" id=\"uf10c2098\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud476708c\" id=\"ud476708c\">&lt;*&gt;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ubc6dddf7\" id=\"ubc6dddf7\"> PPP filtering</span></li><li fid=\"ue11fb314\" data-lake-id=\"u929fd95b\" id=\"u929fd95b\"><code data-lake-id=\"ub35e43e3\" id=\"ub35e43e3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3f6e1135\" id=\"u3f6e1135\">&lt;*&gt;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u17724012\" id=\"u17724012\"> PPP support for async serial ports</span></li><li fid=\"ue11fb314\" data-lake-i