6957eb\" id=\"ub66957eb\"> 清空并重写 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u6eea69c8\" id=\"u6eea69c8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9b285eeb\" id=\"u9b285eeb\">/etc/config/network</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf5b78d23\" id=\"uf5b78d23\"> 文件，剔除 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u8fc0abb9\" id=\"u8fc0abb9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub642d4d1\" id=\"ub642d4d1\">lan</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"udc8d90af\" id=\"udc8d90af\"> 配置，仅保留 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u6d354928\" id=\"u6d354928\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc75721eb\" id=\"uc75721eb\">loopback</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u16f8c0b3\" id=\"u16f8c0b3\"> 和 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uaa04f0da\" id=\"uaa04f0da\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufd669c36\" id=\"ufd669c36\">wan</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u30d3d5a8\" id=\"u30d3d5a8\">：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4d392d1a\" id=\"u4d392d1a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u66f23057\" id=\"u66f23057\">​</span><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22shell%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22config%20interface%20'loopback'%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20option%20device%20'lo'%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20option%20proto%20'static'%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20option%20ipaddr%20'127.0.0.1'%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20option%20netmask%20'255.0.0.0'%5Cn%5Cnconfig%20interface%20'wan'%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20option%20proto%20'pppoe'%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20option%20device%20'eth0'%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20option%20username%20'%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7'%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20option%20password%20'%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84%E5%AF%86%E7%A0%81'%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bzMjU%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"kULnY\" id=\"kULnY\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua45afebc\" id=\"ua45afebc\"> 环境层：解决网络鉴权断开问题</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uf3112c7e\" id=\"uf3112c7e\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf2888826\" id=\"uf2888826\">现象：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uba009ee7\" id=\"uba009ee7\"> 拨号日志显示鉴权成功并获取 IP，但瞬间报 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ue110f895\" id=\"ue110f895\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1dcc6aa5\" id=\"u1dcc6aa5\">LCP terminated by peer (User request)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ueec23f76\" id=\"ueec23f76\">。 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uea4ca2d3\" id=\"uea4ca2d3\">原因：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2f353f82\" id=\"u2f353f82\"> 运营商或机房交换机的多设备在线限制、MAC 地址白名单限制，或 IPv6 协商异常。 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud0482e4f\" id=\"ud0482e4f\">排查与修复：</span></strong></p><ol list=\"uf94e858b\"><li fid=\"ud41b76e8\" data-lake-id=\"u86546c4f\" id=\"u86546c4f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6a288c24\" id=\"u6a288c24\">断开原来使用该账号拨号的旧设备，等待 2-3 分钟让服务器释放 Session。</span></li><li fid=\"ud41b76e8\" data-lake-id=\"ud0b7deba\" id=\"ud0b7deba\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub2d86d82\" id=\"ub2d86d82\">若存在 MAC 地址绑定限制，在 network 配置文件中的 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u0b40302e\" id=\"u0b40302e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6c75faf7\" id=\"u6c75faf7\">wan</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u76e948fc\" id=\"u76e948fc\"> 接口下添加 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u2039f5f3\" id=\"u2039f5f3\"><span data-lake-id=\"udd569f07\" id=\"udd569f07\">option macaddr '旧设备MAC'</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ufa5feb90\" id=\"ufa5feb90\"> 进行克隆。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"uc903c2c2\" id=\"uc903c2c2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u709c2eba\" id=\"u709c2eba\">执行以下命令完成最终拨号：</span></p><ol list=\"uf94e858b\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"ud41b76e8\" data-lake-id=\"u3eb3779c\" id=\"u3eb3779c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub7828a2e\" id=\"ub7828a2e\">Bash</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22ifconfig%20eth0